@fn lower
@purpose Main entry for token stream -> IrModule. Orchestrates the multi-pass analysis + codegen.
@pre tokens lexed; index populated; checker has run (store/registry/treg ready); table has bindings. [src: codegen.aria:35]
@post Returns IrModule with all functions lowered, string constants pooled, trampolines/derives/monomorphizations generated. [src: lower.aria:19641]
@complexity O(N) passes x O(M) walks (N = decls, M = tokens); pass 3 (body lowering) dominates. [src: lower.aria:19638]
@thread_safety not-safe — mutates Lowerer state throughout. [src: lower.aria:19635]
@antipatterns Lowerer rebuilds on every state change (immutable-struct style). Expensive for bootstrap but keeps the lowering pure; do NOT refactor to in-place mutation without auditing aliasing. [src: lower.aria:88-99]

