@fn generate_llvm_ir_to_file
@purpose Top-level emit: IrModule -> .ll text -> clang -> binary.
@pre m is fully populated; output_path writable; runtime_path points to runtime object file. [src: codegen.aria:49]
@post Writes .ll, invokes clang; returns empty DiagnosticBag on success or an error with exit code. [src: codegen.aria:60-74]
@complexity O(all_insts + all_strings) for text emission + O(1) clang invocation. [src: llvm.aria:447]
@thread_safety requires-sync — writes to output file and invokes subprocess. [src: codegen.aria:60, codegen.aria:67]
@antipatterns Single clang invocation (no parallel compilation); all functions serialized into one .ll (no LTO granularity) — revisit if link time dominates. [src: codegen.aria:67-73]

