@purpose End-to-end compile from a single Aria source file: lex -> resolve -> check -> lower -> LLVM -> clang -> binary.
@pre Source is valid UTF-8; output_path / runtime_path writable. [src: codegen.aria:19]
@post Writes executable; returns error bag if any phase fails (stops at first error). [src: codegen.aria:24-42]
@complexity O(source_len) lex + O(tokens) resolve/check/lower + O(funcs x insts) codegen. [src: codegen.aria:19-42]
@thread_safety requires-sync — I/O + subprocess. [src: codegen.aria:19]
