@fn _build_gc_tables
@purpose One-pass O(insts + temps) computation of GC root marks + slot assignments for a function. Enables O(1) lookups via _lg_is_root / _lg_slot_for.
@pre f.insts contains all instructions; f.local_count is set. [src: llvm.aria:272-273]
@post Returns LlvmGen with gc_is_root / gc_slot / gc_root_count populated. [src: llvm.aria:354-355]
@complexity O(insts + temps). [src: llvm.aria:274-353]
@antipatterns The pre-caching version replaces an O(temps x insts) hot path — never reintroduce per-instruction root recomputation. [src: llvm.aria:266-268]

