@fn _lower_bodies
@purpose Multi-pass body lowering: pass 1 struct layouts, pass 2 fn signatures, pass 3 bodies -> IR.
@pre DeclIndex populated; pool/store/registry ready. [src: lower.aria:937]
@post Lowerer.module now contains lowered functions. [src: lower.aria:937]
@complexity O(N * M * P) worst-case (decls x tokens x body size). [src: lower.aria:937-990]
